# Chapter 13, worked example: the three depreciation methods on one asset
A1 Cost
B1 1000
A2 Salvage
B2 100
A3 Life
B3 5
A5 Year
B5 SLN
C5 DDB
D5 SYD
A6 1
B6 @SLN($B$1,$B$2,$B$3)
C6 @DDB($B$1,$B$2,$B$3,A6)
D6 @SYD($B$1,$B$2,$B$3,A6)
A7 2
A8 3
A9 4
A10 5
do /cb6..d6~b7~/cb6..d6~b8~/cb6..d6~b9~/cb6..d6~b10~
show B6
show C6
show D6
show C7
show D7
show C8
show D8
show C9
show D9
show C10
show D10
B11 @SUM(B6..B10)
C11 @SUM(C6..C10)
D11 @SUM(D6..D10)
show B11
show C11
show D11
